===Etymology 2===
Presumably from {{der|non|orv|столъ||table}}.

====Noun====
{{non-noun|m|stóls|stólar}}

# a [[table]] for [[eating]] and [[drinking]]
#* ''[[w:Bósa_saga_ok_Herrauðs|Bósa saga ok Herrauðs]]'' 12, in '''1830''', [[w:Carl_Christian_Rafn|C. C. Rafn]], ''Fornaldar sögur Nordrlanda'', Volume III. Copenhagen, page [http://books.google.com/books?id=M9sFAAAAQAAJ&pg=PA223 223]:
