===Etymology 3===
Ultimately from {{der|non|grc|στόλος||army, fleet, troop}}.

====Noun====
{{non-noun|m|stóls|stólar}}

# {{lb|non|especially in compounds}} a [[stock]] (especially of weapons and ships), [[host]], [[fleet]]
